Subject: [PATCH 133/162] hjviewer: the phone's file transfer in the app's look
 (U15)

U15 (UX-S5, phone file screen, design u15.md 3-6 with its review):
- The Local / Remote switch is the palette's segmented control in the
  1.7.0 form of mobile/widgets/gesture_help.dart: inactive card with a
  border and divider in border, active primarySoft with primaryStrong
  (review R1: primarySoft against fill alone was 1.01:1). 88 x 36, 14 px,
  rounded icons that do not repeat W7's desktop icon. The app bar title
  is in FittedBox(fit: BoxFit.scaleDown), so 320-360 dp phones scale it
  down instead of clipping 'Remote' (review R2). W7's [to remote screen]
  button and leadingWidth 96 stay.
- File rows: a flat card, faint blue (primarySoft) when chosen with
  primaryStrong text, 28 px rounded icons in textSecondary (primary when
  chosen), the date and size line 12 px textSecondary with digits of one
  width. Colours from hjvFileRowColors in common/hjv_phone_files_look.dart,
  the same function and values as the shared hjv_session_look.dart that
  lane keys adds in this wave (not on this base); the merge keeps one.
- The bottom bar (selected, paste here?, waiting, successful, error) is a
  card with a top border instead of the see-through blue: title 14/600 in
  text, line 13 px textSecondary, icons textSecondary 22 px. Waiting shows
  a 22 px spinner, success check_circle_outline in successText (review
  R7: success is 2.62:1 on card), error error_outline in danger.
- Delete in the bottom bar takes danger through IconButton.color, so it
  greys out when nothing is chosen (review R8).
No text, behaviour or layout order changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
